WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.463
My eyes see.

2
00:00:08.464 --> 00:00:13.894
I see colors all around.

3
00:00:13.895 --> 00:00:16.739
My ears hear.

4
00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.014
I hear a drum sound.

5
00:00:20.015 --> 00:00:22.671
My nose smells.

6
00:00:22.672 --> 00:00:27.355
I smell pizza to eat.

7
00:00:27.356 --> 00:00:29.777
My tongue tastes.

8
00:00:29.778 --> 00:00:35.680
I taste a candy treat.

9
00:00:35.681 --> 00:00:38.039
My hand touches.

10
00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:43.887
I touch a soft kitten.

11
00:00:43.888 --> 00:00:51.389
I see, I hear, I smell, I taste, I touch.

12
00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:57.744
My five senses.
